# Personal state, logs and chat-derived content - never commit these.
#
# config.json      your chat_url, default_dir and model choice
# state.json       which orders/files this machine has already handled
# inbox/ downloads/ outbox/ drafts/ terminals/   real work orders and files from the chat
# PLAN-continuation-and-accounts.md      the local plan - it names real accounts and a real project
# NEEDS-ORDER.md                         written when a turn stalled - names the real chat
# *.log *.out *.pid *.lock               runtime noise

config.json
state.json
bridge-target.json
PLAN-continuation-and-accounts.md
watcher.log
watcher.out
watcher.pid
watcher.lock
terminal.log
NEEDS-ORDER.md

inbox/
downloads/
outbox/
drafts/
terminals/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
